WEBVTT

00:21:28.846 --> 00:21:30.822
I was never here.

00:21:30.846 --> 00:21:33.822
(Laughter)

00:21:33.846 --> 00:21:35.822
The world is my playground.

00:21:35.846 --> 00:21:39.822
(Laughter)

00:21:39.846 --> 00:21:41.822
I want to keep trigger-pullers
trigger-happy.

00:21:41.846 --> 00:21:43.942
I want the rules to be
as loose as possible.

00:21:43.966 --> 00:21:46.252
Because when the thing
gets prevented in Chicago

00:21:46.276 --> 00:21:47.822
with the three million dead

00:21:47.846 --> 00:21:50.608
that perverts our political
system beyond all recognition,

00:21:50.632 --> 00:21:53.109
these are the guys who are going
to kill them first.

00:21:53.323 --> 00:21:55.299
So it's better off to have them
make some mistakes along the way

00:21:55.323 --> 00:21:56.822
than to see that.

00:21:56.846 --> 00:21:58.822
Reserve component --

00:21:58.846 --> 00:22:01.822
National Guard reserves
overwhelmingly Sys Admin.